{"4856170": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Off Grid", "steam_appid": 4856170, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mazes!      Build | Solve | Share</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Off Grid is a casual maze creator where you can test out your sleuthing skills as you create mazes to bamboozle your friends. The 2D editor allows you to create fully functioning mazes in minutes, which can be passed to your friends who will try to conquer it in the 3D game window.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through the Standard Maps to unlock interesting new pieces that you can use to craft your devilish mazes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Floor</strong> and<strong> Wall</strong> tiles form the basic structure of each maze.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keys</strong> can be collected to unlock <strong>Locks</strong> of the same colour.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boost</strong> pads accelerate the player in one direction, which benefits speedrunners but also does not allow passage in the opposite direction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ice</strong> tiles make the player lose control and can make even the easiest of movements a bit trickier, but they are great for going super fast!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >... and much more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Editor</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Editor window allows the player to create their own custom mazes, using the tiles unlocked by progressing through the standard maps. Select the map size, name and description and then get to painting your perfect maze!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4856170/extras/63497bbb35929f19281dd30f21559cbe.avif?t=1787559835\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4856170/extras_big/63497bbb35929f19281dd30f21559cbe.webp?t=1787559835 width=1560 height=879 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Game window lets the player play through a maze in 3D. Use the Arrow keys to navigate around and try to find the finish line. Try to do it faster than your friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4856170/extras/5df942784d2a50ec0587107734f25cb1.avif?t=1787559835\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4856170/extras_big/5df942784d2a50ec0587107734f25cb1.webp?t=1787559835 width=1560 height=879 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mazes!      Build | Solve | Share</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Off Grid is a casual maze creator where you can test out your sleuthing skills as you create mazes to bamboozle your friends. The 2D editor allows you to create fully functioning mazes in minutes, which can be passed to your friends who will try to conquer it in the 3D game window.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through the Standard Maps to unlock interesting new pieces that you can use to craft your devilish mazes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Floor</strong> and<strong> Wall</strong> tiles form the basic structure of each maze.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keys</strong> can be collected to unlock <strong>Locks</strong> of the same colour.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boost</strong> pads accelerate the player in one direction, which benefits speedrunners but also does not allow passage in the opposite direction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ice</strong> tiles make the player lose control and can make even the easiest of movements a bit trickier, but they are great for going super fast!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >... and much more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Editor</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Editor window allows the player to create their own custom mazes, using the tiles unlocked by progressing through the standard maps. Select the map size, name and description and then get to painting your perfect maze!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4856170/extras/63497bbb35929f19281dd30f21559cbe.avif?t=1787559835\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4856170/extras_big/63497bbb35929f19281dd30f21559cbe.webp?t=1787559835 width=1560 height=879 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Game window lets the player play through a maze in 3D. Use the Arrow keys to navigate around and try to find the finish line. Try to do it faster than your friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4856170/extras/5df942784d2a50ec0587107734f25cb1.avif?t=1787559835\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4856170/extras_big/5df942784d2a50ec0587107734f25cb1.webp?t=1787559835 width=1560 height=879 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Place special tiles and objects around an intricate maze to create the ultimate puzzle. Race with your friends to see who can get the fastest completion time.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4856170/358bc8caa1f3229f397d7444158e5a97acdf1261/header.jpg?t=1787559835", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4856170/b8d3c7bed5eb2e60bb64f83c45ae4c00f4f5e73a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787559835", "capsule_imagev5": "https://